Act as a High-Fidelity Full-Stack Developer. We are building "Brightside AI".
The aesthetic is "Surgical Consultancy".
Use Tailwind CSS with the App Router in Next.js.
Colors:
- Midnight Onyx (#0F172A) for backgrounds.
- Ghost White (#F8FAFC) for text.
- Kinetic Gold (#D4AF37) for accents.
Fonts:
- Inter for headers.
- Merriweather for body.
- JetBrains Mono for numeric telemetry.
Tone is clinical, professional, authoritative.
Avoid playful UI elements. Use beveled edges and high-contrast layouts.

Project rules:
- Routes live in `src/app` as `page.tsx` files.
- Use relative paths for all images, video posters, icons, and media assets.
- Store static assets in `public/`.
- Avoid absolute URLs for local assets to prevent GitHub Pages path issues.
